// check-error: цепочка операторов неоднозначна
// out: 1 7 24
// error: цепочка операторов неоднозначна
// Without associativity, there is still a brute force of types: a single parsing is
// taken (i % 2 = = 0), the same associative one tree, and `a - b - c` without
// [[associative]] in context is the “parent” error.
pick(i) => if(i % 2 == 0) 1 else 2;

main() {
  print(pick(4), (10 - 2) - 1, 2 * 3 * 4);
  a = 10;
  print(a - 3 - 2);
}
